ALTER - Example
Database Management Systems
1. Adding a New Column
ALTER TABLE employee
ADD COLUMN department_id INT;
2. Reposition a Column ( ‘department_id’ after ‘name’)
ALTER TABLE employee
MODIFY COLUMN department_id INT AFTER name;
