Database Management Systems
Neo4j - Practice Session
To filter a node with properties and with specific value:
There are multiple nodes with label book and associated with properties like author, title,
pages, price and publisher
Search all nodes where author of the book is “Chetan ”
Match (n:Label{property:”value”}) return n;
Match (n:Book{author:”Chetan”}) return n;
// return all the nodes with label book and property author with value “Chetan” , if not
available returns zero records
Match (n:Book1{Author:"Elmasri"}) return n;
// returns nodes with label Book1 and Author value Elmasri

Database Management Systems
Neo4j - Practice Session
To filter a node using operators (AND, OR, < , >……)
Search all nodes whose author is a1 or a2 and price of the book is one thousand.
Match (n: Book) where n.price<1000 AND (n.author="Neel" or n.author = "Navathe")
return n;
// return all the nodes with label book with price <1000 and author with value Neel or
Navathe

